# Star study: every combination of the four 12-pointed stars (tips 30, 60, 90, 120), with regular polygons.
# Each row allows the regular polygons and its stars, and requires each of its stars.

name a12_stars
k 1 8

angle A3 60
angle A4 90
angle A6 120
angle A12 150
angle A12p30 30
angle A12d30 300
angle A12p60 60
angle A12d60 270
angle A12p90 90
angle A12d90 240
angle A12p120 120
angle A12d120 210

